  <item>
    <title>玫瑰叔：在故事缝隙里穿针引线，以重温经典搭建公共空间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fd9297e1eb34a939f91b2b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fd9297e1eb34a939f91b2b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/36726929?" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/36726929?"><span>玫瑰叔</span></a><span>是一位讲书的 UP 主。如果你是《冰与火之歌》系列的受众，应该不太可能没听说过他。</span></p><p><span>近些年来，玫瑰叔品评的范围也越来越广，包括各种西方文学经典名著，以及中国的武侠小说等等。</span></p><p><span>如果仔细想想，所谓的“内容”，基本上都是基于已有材料的二次解读和阐述。所以，像玫瑰叔和重轻这样的创作者，常常会陷入各种各样的自我认同危机之中：这个分工，究竟是不是今天社会里一个长期的、正当的、有价值的位置？它的价值在哪里？</span></p><p><span>无论你做了多少内容，做了多少年，这种自我怀疑都不会完全消失。所以今天，重轻和玫瑰叔对了对各自心里的答案。</span></p><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:00:01</a></span></strong><span> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">00:02:56</a></span></strong><span> 从线下讲书到辞职做UP主</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">00:07:10</a></span></strong><span> 做UP主是不是一份正经职业</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">00:18:01</a></span></strong><span> 从冰与火之歌走出舒适区的尝试</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">00:25:02</a></span></strong><span> 讲书像导游：重构文本帮观众理解</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">00:37:37</a></span></strong><span> 讲书人的角色：搭一座缘分的桥</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">00:53:25</a></span></strong><span> 在互联网上发表观点的风险与内耗</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3835">01:03:55</a></span></strong><span> 创作者面对负面反馈的日常消耗</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4085">01:08:05</a></span></strong><span> UP主的盈利困境与生存方式</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4370">01:12:50</a></span></strong><span> 经典作品在新时代的价值观变迁</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4893">01:21:33</a></span></strong><span> 年轻人不再被"忠义"打动的原因</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5633">01:33:53</a></span></strong><span> 创作者与受众的"类朋友"关系</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6313">01:45:13</a></span></strong><span> 陪伴观众的责任感与内心的坎</span></p><p><span> </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6738">01:52:18</a></span></strong><span> 使命感驱动与未来想做的事</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：玫瑰叔</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>主播：重轻</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>后期：Geelish、蜡笔</span></strong></p><p><span>蜉蝣天地是一个</span><strong><span>视频播客</span></strong><span>，由汉洋和重轻轮番（或共同）主持。</span></p><p><span>你可以在 Bilibili YouTube 等各大视频平台搜索 </span><strong><span>蜉蝣天地 Meanders</span></strong><span> 订阅收看，也可以在小宇宙、Apple Podcast 等播客客户端订阅收听。</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3546862070007931" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3546862070007931"><span>🔗 Bilibili</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@FuyoutiandiMeanders" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@FuyoutiandiMeanders"><span>🔗 YouTube</span></a></p><p><span>联系我们，请致信 geelish@funes.world 或添加 FUNES_GEE</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nreKtKlFVsDeVkigPqkVGY_s4-tQ.png"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
