  <item>
    <title>Demone: 亲历舞曲文化本土融合的DJ，如何用复古老歌扣响人心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69da9cf6b977fb2c47af60c1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69da9cf6b977fb2c47af60c1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目的嘉宾 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c862f9b0000000011036d5b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c862f9b0000000011036d5b"><span>Demone</span></a><span> 有很多身份，比如说糖蒜广播的创始人、摄影师、设计师等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但这期节目我们聊的只是他其中一个身份，就是 DJ，就指那种纯粹的服务舞池，调动人们的情绪一起跳舞的那种狭义的 DJ。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Demone 的 DJ 生涯呼应了很多东西，比如西方俱乐部文化融入本土的这几十年的历程，还有一点让人一直心有戚戚，就是风流快活、享受当下这种事对于国人来说一直不是一个天然的自发的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 嘉宾介绍：Demone 的多重身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">00:03:10</a> 入行起点：自学计算机，误入音乐圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">00:05:01</a> 嚎叫唱片五年：中国地下摇滚的亲历者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">00:07:12</a> 乐队处境对比：从苦熬求生到中产趣味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">00:09:11</a> 离开嚎叫：职业唱片设计师与企划时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">00:12:21</a> 糖蒜广播：中国播客鼻祖的诞生与爆发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">00:15:08</a> 苹果 Offer 与国际台：为理想放弃工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">00:16:30</a> 初识俱乐部：从摇滚少年到 Club 新手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">00:19:53</a> 用电脑放歌：DJ 生涯的野路子起步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">00:23:07</a> 针刺疗法的拜师学艺：正统 DJ 训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">00:30:01</a> 服务舞池的心理学：看人下菜碟的技艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">00:40:01</a> 干歌湿歌与极简革命：电子音乐的分叉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3121">00:52:01</a> 野路子与正统之争：先做再学的工作模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">00:58:01</a> 摩登天空年会：一次特殊的 DJ 实例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4801">01:20:01</a> 老歌的力量：怀旧调动的不只是身体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5242">01:27:22</a> 三亚出租车上的顿悟：中文老歌的觉醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6061">01:41:01</a> 中国没有"嗨"的原生词：舞池文化的本土困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7444">02:04:04</a> DJ 的实际作用：调动人群、制造快乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：Demone</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：重轻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后期：Geelish、蜡笔</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Take a bow - Madonna</span></p><span></span><p><span>Black or White - Michael Jackson</span></p><span></span><p><span>Satisfaction - Benny Benassi</span></p><span></span><p><span>Body Language - M.A.N.D.Y. vs Booka Shade</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stayin' Alive - Bee Gees</span></p><span></span><p><span>More Than a Woman - Bee Gees</span></p><span></span><p><span>Surprise (Cha Cha 31) - Alessandro Olivato</span></p><span></span><p><span>Song 2 - Blur</span></p><span></span><p><span>别再问我什么是迪斯科 - 新裤子</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱 - 小虎队</span></p><span></span><p><span>美丽新世界 - S.H.E</span></p><span></span><p><span>Y.M.C.A - Village People</span></p><span></span><p><span>蜉蝣天地是一个</span><strong><span>视频播客</span></strong><span>，由汉洋和重轻轮番（或共同）主持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在 Bilibili YouTube 等各大视频平台搜索 </span><strong><span>蜉蝣天地 Meanders</span></strong><span> 订阅收看，也可以在小宇宙、Apple Podcast 等播客客户端订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3546862070007931" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3546862070007931"><span>🔗 Bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@FuyoutiandiMeanders" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@FuyoutiandiMeanders"><span>🔗 YouTube</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们，请致信 </span><a href="mailto:geelish@funes.world"><span>geelish@funes.world</span></a><span> 或添加 FUNES_GEE</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fla_HIxVmJUuPz4fgQ6i_qihw6P3.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
