  <item>
    <title>风霁：优化体验，还是塑造现实？平台推荐算法探秘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69611215e235ea65bc00d10e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69611215e235ea65bc00d10e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的嘉宾风霁是一位资深的推荐算法工程师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>风霁在国内的几家大厂的推荐算法场景有 8 年的研究与工作经验，他参与了推荐算法的基础模型复杂化的整个进程：从最早的简单机器学习、深度学习，到目前大模型相关的技术在推荐场景下的各种结合应用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这其中涉及到了用户体验层面的诸多问题，比如信息茧房、社区内容生态、流量公平性等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和风霁的这次对话，我们还追问了很多问题，包括技术的事实层面，也包括了一些科技和文化领域的交叉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都生活在这个算法驱动的信息时代，算法塑造我们的现实，它远远不止是一个工程问题。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">00:01:52</a> 推荐算法的发展历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">00:18:16</a> 算法到底在优化什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">00:32:33</a>流量玄学与“版本”焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">00:54:50</a> 播客的流量困局与视频化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3812">01:03:32</a>千亿次播放背后的供需匹配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">01:22:20</a> 一条视频被上传后会发生什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5738">01:35:38</a> 信息茧房与随机分发实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7053">01:57:33</a> 算法的伦理边界与社会责任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10005">02:46:45</a> 生成式 AI 与推荐的未来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>风霁</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>重轻、汉洋</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后期：</span></strong><span>Jackie、Geelish</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong><span>重轻 - 养虎巷</span></p><span></span><p><span>蜉蝣天地是一个</span><strong><span>视频播客</span></strong><span>，由汉洋和重轻轮番（或共同）主持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在 Bilibili YouTube 抖音精选等各大视频平台搜索 </span><strong><span>蜉蝣天地 Meanders</span></strong><span> 订阅收看，也可以在小宇宙、Apple Podcast 等播客客户端订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3546862070007931" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3546862070007931"><span>🔗 Bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@FuyoutiandiMeanders" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@FuyoutiandiMeanders"><span>🔗 YouTube</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7593282892063640866/?from_ssr=1&amp;video_share_track_ver=style_v1&amp;life_share_ext=&amp;did=MS4wLjABAAAA_kJr_V8bYifuYLgQcO7JXjPBqxuFMcItdBo25Lf3B0sItJQMmSUYNsE2SSBHNmQJ&amp;mid=0&amp;ts=1768196588&amp;share_track_info=%7B%22link_description_type%22:%22%22%7D&amp;region=CN&amp;share_sign=XUOWfJdu6Ii1gEIT0rK2KxV84HfmHvL8XfAoGKEagaA-&amp;tt_from=share_to&amp;with_sec_did=1&amp;from_aid=568863&amp;titleType=title&amp;utm_source=share_to&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;activity_info=%7B%22social_share_time%22:%221768197070%22,%22social_author_id%22:%224255573961605472%22,%22social_share_id%22:%2270473413418_1768197070%22,%22social_share_user_id%22:%2270473413418%22%7D&amp;timestamp=1768197071&amp;share_version=370200&amp;ug_share_id=f6a617b4c3e73_1768197073939&amp;u_code=kg16hf3m&amp;iid=MS4wLjABAAAARlIQEGGQaNRizClAKTZKX0NncJoCmU3Qhg5DKuWcEjJvGBTaioLRx-xMK_bsQVFQ&amp;utm_campaign=client_share&amp;app=douyin_select" data-url="https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7593282892063640866/?from_ssr=1&amp;video_share_track_ver=style_v1&amp;life_share_ext=&amp;did=MS4wLjABAAAA_kJr_V8bYifuYLgQcO7JXjPBqxuFMcItdBo25Lf3B0sItJQMmSUYNsE2SSBHNmQJ&amp;mid=0&amp;ts=1768196588&amp;share_track_info=%7B%22link_description_type%22:%22%22%7D&amp;region=CN&amp;share_sign=XUOWfJdu6Ii1gEIT0rK2KxV84HfmHvL8XfAoGKEagaA-&amp;tt_from=share_to&amp;with_sec_did=1&amp;from_aid=568863&amp;titleType=title&amp;utm_source=share_to&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;activity_info=%7B%22social_share_time%22:%221768197070%22,%22social_author_id%22:%224255573961605472%22,%22social_share_id%22:%2270473413418_1768197070%22,%22social_share_user_id%22:%2270473413418%22%7D&amp;timestamp=1768197071&amp;share_version=370200&amp